# The smashio-app Vercel project builds only website/ (Root Directory setting), but `vercel
# deploy` from the monorepo root scans everything else too. Without this, it tries to upload the
# whole tree (ui/'s node_modules alone is tens of thousands of files) and the CLI upload aborts.
ui/
supabase/
data/
docs/
scripts/
node_modules/
.expo/
android/
ios/
